    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A wonderful opportunity to acquire a beautifully cared-for home in the ever-popular Earlsfort development, just moments from the village of Blackrock and its stunning coastline.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you step inside, this lovely home has a warm and welcoming feel, with bright, comfortable accommodation and a host of thoughtful features throughout. The kitchen is finished with beautiful quartz worktops, adding a touch of elegance and practicality to the heart of the home, while gas central heating ensures a cosy and comfortable living environment.\r\n\r\nEnergy efficiency is another standout feature, with an impressive A3 BER rating and solar panels, offering the benefit of a more energy-efficient home and helping to keep running costs down.\r\n\r\nA Stira attic access provides excellent additional storage, while the recently paved rear garden creates a lovely, low-maintenance space to enjoy morning coffee, summer evenings or time with family and friends.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned in a peaceful and established setting, yet close to everything Blackrock has to offer, this is a home that combines comfort, style and convenience beautifully.\r\n\r\nBlue Sky Property and their servants or agents assume no responsibility for and give no guarantees, undertakings or warranties concerning the accuracy, completeness or up to date nature of the information and do not accept any liability whatsoever arising from any errors or omissions. The information does not constitute or form part of a contract and cannot be relied on as a representation of fact. Subject to contract / contract denied. Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate, and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway : 2.1m x 4.7m \r\nSitting Room : 3.08m x 4.56m \r\nW.C. : 1m x 1.02m \r\nKitchen : 3.6m x 5.9m \r\nUtility Room : 1.9m x 2.73m \r\nBedroom 1 : 3.5m x 3.11m \r\nEn-suite : 1.06m x 3.14m \r\nBedroom 2 : 3.6m x 2.72m \r\nBedroom 3 : 3.14m x 3.21m \r\nBathroom : 2.4m x 2.7m"
      },
